-- Window: RightControl | Unload: Settings -> Unload | API: getgenv().RobScriptTS
--
-- What it does:
--   Auto Play - hits every note of your part with perfect timing, hold notes included.
--   Auto Game - joins the orchestra, takes a free part, votes for the next song and can
--               force a difficulty, so a session keeps running with no input at all.
--   Session   - songs played, coins earned, level, XP and live judgement counters.
--
-- How it works: judging in this game is fully client side. RhythmClient keeps the
-- hittable notes in a local list and laneDown(lane) picks the nearest unjudged note of
-- that lane, compares it with the local song clock and calls registerHit. The script
-- finds that laneDown closure inside the live client (structural scan over getgc: the
-- only RhythmClient closure that captures the game Config table, three server clock
-- numbers and a note list), then calls it on the frames where a note is due. No key
-- simulation, no remote rewriting, no hooks.

